          {
            "title": "Find the risky operation",
            "id": 152111,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un testo con una quantità non valida può generare <code>ValueError</code>. Da quale operazione dovrebbe proteggere un blocco <code>try</code> mirato da questo errore previsto?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Conversione di <code>form[\"quantity\"]</code> con <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Visualizzazione del messaggio di importazione</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Salvataggio dell'ordine completato</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Conversione di <code>form[\"quantity\"]</code> con <code>int()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Anche il salvataggio può generare <code>ValueError</code>. Cosa va nel <code>try</code> perché l'avviso riguardi solo una quantità non valida?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"save_order(form, quantity)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo la conversione di form[\"quantity\"] con int().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La conversione e save_order() insieme.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo save_order().</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tutte e tre le righe, così ogni ValueError mostra l'avviso sulla quantità.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo la conversione di form[\"quantity\"] con int().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep the try block narrow",
            "id": 152112,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il blocco incentrato sulla conversione della quantità.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"process\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(form)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Importing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    quantity = int(form[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>try</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch the expected error",
            "id": 152113,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gestisci solo l'errore previsto per il testo numerico non valido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Intercetta solo il testo numerico non valido e restituisci un valore di errore senza inventare un numero di posti.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"seat_parser.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"KeyError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>ValueError</code>, seguito da <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose the recovery point",
            "id": 152114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>parse_port()</code> converte il testo. <code>start_server()</code> può annullare l'avvio e mostrare un messaggio utile. Dove dovrebbe essere intercettato <code>ValueError</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">All'interno di <code>start_server()</code>, intorno alla chiamata a <code>parse_port()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dentro <code>parse_port()</code>, prima di chiamare <code>int()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">All'interno della funzione integrata <code>int()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">All'interno di <code>start_server()</code>, intorno alla chiamata a <code>parse_port()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Due chiamanti usano <code>parse_port()</code>, ma solo <code>start_server()</code> può annullare l'avvio. Dove va gestito l'errore?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Intercetta ValueError in start_server() intorno alla chiamata a parse_port().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Intercettalo in parse_port() e restituisci sempre 0 a ogni chiamante.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Intercettalo in entrambe le funzioni, facendo restituire prima 0 a parse_port().</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Intercettalo dopo che la chiamata a parse_port() è già terminata.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Intercetta ValueError in start_server() intorno alla chiamata a parse_port().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep other work visible",
            "id": 152115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali parti del codice dovrebbero essere spostate fuori dal blocco <code>try</code> per rendere la gestione degli errori più mirata?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a <code>save_order()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La conversione della quantità</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ogni riga nella funzione</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a <code>save_order()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La quantità è valida, ma <code>save_order()</code> genera <code>ValueError</code>. Solo gli errori di quantità devono mostrare l'avviso. Cosa va spostato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = quantity * order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;price&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  save_order(total)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a save_order().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo la conversione della quantità.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo il calcolo del totale; lascia save_order() protetto.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nulla; gli stessi tipi di eccezione richiedono sempre la stessa risposta.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il calcolo del totale e la chiamata a save_order().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Handle a missing key",
            "id": 152116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il primo gestore specifico per una chiave di quantità mancante.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Restituisci messaggi distinti per una chiave quantity mancante e un testo intero non valido.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"order_import.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(order)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(order[\" /><text value=\"&quot;quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid quantity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"167\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Missing quantity&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>KeyError</code>, seguito da <code>\"Invalid quantity\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Protect a port setting",
            "id": 152117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede se <code>settings[\"port\"]</code> contiene un valore come <code>\"abc\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La funzione restituisce <code>\"Invalid port\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce <code>\"abc\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La funzione restituisce <code>\"Invalid port\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In questa funzione, cosa succede se <code>settings</code> non ha la chiave <code>\"port\"</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  port = int(settings[\" /><text value=\"&quot;port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid port&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" port\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">KeyError esce dalla funzione perché questo gestore non lo intercetta.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce \"Invalid port\".</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce 0.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">La funzione restituisce None dopo aver intercettato l'errore.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">KeyError esce dalla funzione perché questo gestore non lo intercetta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check a focused handler",
            "id": 152118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>process_order()</code> può saltare un ordine. Quale progettazione mantiene il gestore focalizzato e permette agli errori non correlati di emergere?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gestisci <code>ValueError</code> intorno alla conversione della quantità in <code>process_order()</code>, poi calcola e salva al di fuori del gestore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Racchiudi conversione, calcolo e salvataggio in un blocco <code>except</code> semplice</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Gestisci ogni errore all'interno dell'helper di conversione e restituisci <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gestisci <code>ValueError</code> intorno alla conversione della quantità in <code>process_order()</code>, poi calcola e salva al di fuori del gestore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
